<div class="legal-page-container">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="legal-title">Refund & Return Policy</h1>
    <div class="legal-content">
      <p>Thank you for shopping at Seravolve.</p>
      <h2>Returns</h2>
      <p>We accept returns <strong>only if the product is broken or damaged</strong> upon arrival. You have <strong>5 days</strong> from the date you received the item to notify us of the damage and request a return.</p>
      <p>To be eligible for a return, your item must be unused and in the same condition that you received it. It must also be in the original packaging.</p>
      <p>We do not accept returns for buyer's remorse, change of mind, or products that have been opened and used, unless they arrived damaged or defective.</p>
      <h2>Refunds</h2>
      <p>Once we receive your return and inspect the item, we will immediately notify you on the status of your refund. If your return is approved, we will initiate a refund to your credit card (or original method of payment). You will receive the credit within a certain amount of days, depending on your card issuer's policies.</p>
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have received a damaged or broken item, please contact our support team immediately with photographic evidence of the damage.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .legal-page-container { padding: 80px 0; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .legal-title { font-size: 2.5rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; font-family: var(--font-heading); color: #0A1E30; }
  .legal-content h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #0A1E30; }
  .legal-content p { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .legal-content ul { padding-left: 20px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .legal-content li { margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>

